-- Idempotency keys need to be strings:
SELECT * FROM pgledger_create_transfer(
    :'account1_id',
    :'account2_id',
    10.00,
    metadata => '{"idempotency_key": 123}'
);
ERROR:  Idempotency key (123) must be a JSON string
